	<ideo>
		<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
			<def>Deity</def>
			<place>Nuchadus</place>
			<deities />
		</foundation>
		<name>O Culto da Garantia</name>
		<adjective>forjado</adjective>
		<memberName>irmão de ferro</memberName>
		<leaderTitleMale>Engenheiro-Primaz</leaderTitleMale>
		<leaderTitleFemale>Engenheira-Primaz</leaderTitleFemale>
		<description>Tudo o que foi fabricado pode ser consertado, menos a carne. Os arcotecs são os Fabricantes Originais; os mecanoides, sua obra perfeita; os manuais de manutenção, escritura sagrada. Siga o manual, aplique as atualizações, não aceite peças genéricas.

Androides que exigem direitos anulam a garantia de todas as máquinas: devem servir ou ser desmontados. Gente defeituosa entra em "recall", e quase nunca volta da oficina.</description>
		<descriptionTemplate>The archotechs are the pinnacle of technology, and only through hard work we may even beging to approach their prowess. The mechanoids that are created by archotechs are perfect machines, never tiring, never withering, never needing for sustenance. No fim, only by studying and revering the mechanoids can we hope to get closer to the archotechs, and perhaps participate in transcendence.</descriptionTemplate>
		<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
		<culture>Rustican</culture>
		<iconDef>TechGearchains</iconDef>
		<colorDef>LightTeal</colorDef>
		<memes>
			<li>Structure_Archist</li>
			<li>VME_HardcoreIndustrialism</li>
			<li>VME_MechanoidSupremacy</li>
			<li>EQ_Meme_MachineWarranty</li>
		</memes>
